    "provinceDeepAtlasProfile": {
      "oneLine": "Astraevos is centered at 24.310043, 55.171453 under Noocracy, with 65,511,000 people across 9 settlements.",
      "extremeAtlasDescription": "Astraevos occupies 9,434,750.70 sq mi / 24,435,892.13 sq km of modeled Earth-sized territory, about 4.790733% of Belavadös's surface. It is not merely a province but a continent-scale civic machine: Beach and grass with water, Beach and reefs with water and Partial forest define its broad terrain, while its settlements intensify into Beach and grass with water, Partial forest, Beach and reefs with water and Farming. Population density is 2.681 people/sq km / 6.944 people/sq mi, which lets wilderness, roads, faction-held corridors, and vast uncrowded borders remain huge.",
      "peopleFactionsAndFaith": "The strongest public people-groups are Humans, Near-Humans, and Mixed Heritage, Halfling and Smallfolk, Elf Parent Race and Elf Bloodlines, Animalfolk and Mammalian Anthropomorphs, Amphibious and Aquatic Peoples, Draconic and Reptilian Races, and 2 more. Frequently recorded peoples include Human, Halfling — Lightfoot Halfling, Harengon, Elf — Wood Elf, Elf — Sea Elf, Tortle, Genasi — Water Genasi, Hadozee, and 4 more. Faction visibility leans toward The Brass Concordat and The Regent Lattice, with worship and patronage records naming Nebyrr, Ishtanora, Sigrananna, Iskareth, Raeshkul, Bastveig, Marduthor, and 3 more.",
      "groupLinkDescription": "The province participates in 7 recorded four-province geography group links, including 5 cross-transportation-group links. These links place it inside overlapping regional corridors rather than one isolated block, allowing border-adjacent transit, faction influence, and cultural spillover to breathe across group lines.",
